{"unit_id":"lijx122__dsh-plugin-auth-guard#card-zh","repo":"lijx122/dsh-plugin-auth-guard","commit":"e0eec699877488b570c989177f8da24138e2c255","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-guard 是面向 DSH Web 的访问登录与管理插件：它通过服务端 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求处理加入认证门禁，并在 Web 界面显示登录覆盖层和“安全与访问”设置页。管理员可以设置用户名和密码、控制是否全局要求认证及是否对局域网访问要求认证；登录成功后插件签发会话令牌，也会显示局域网地址。它适合需要从浏览器访问 DSH Web 并管理访问登录的使用场景。插件不依赖外部 API 密钥，初次密码设置需在运行 DSH 的本机完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:516-590","lib/index.js:651-755","lib/client.js:588-603"]}
{"unit_id":"lijx122__dsh-plugin-auth-guard#card-en","repo":"lijx122/dsh-plugin-auth-guard","commit":"e0eec699877488b570c989177f8da24138e2c255","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-guard adds sign-in controls to DSH Web. It checks requests, displays a login overlay, and adds a Security & Access settings page. Administrators can set credentials, require LAN authentication, and view LAN addresses. Login issues a session token; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:516-590","lib/index.js:651-755","lib/client.js:588-603"]}
