{"unit_id":"lijx122__dsh-plugin-auth-guard#feature-login-gate","repo":"lijx122/dsh-plugin-auth-guard","commit":"e0eec699877488b570c989177f8da24138e2c255","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-guard 的功能「访问登录门禁」：插件检查 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求的认证状态；未登录时受限请求会收到未授权响应，浏览器端显示登录覆盖层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:516-590","lib/client.js:254-292"]}
