{"unit_id":"lijx122__dsh-plugin-auth-guard#feature-lan-addresses","repo":"lijx122/dsh-plugin-auth-guard","commit":"e0eec699877488b570c989177f8da24138e2c255","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-guard 的功能「局域网地址查看」：状态接口返回当前检测到的局域网 IPv4 地址和 Web 服务端口，界面可据此展示访问地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:664-677","lib/client.js:435-445"]}
{"unit_id":"lijx122__dsh-plugin-auth-guard#caveat-lan-password-default","repo":"lijx122/dsh-plugin-auth-guard","commit":"e0eec699877488b570c989177f8da24138e2c255","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-guard 使用前须知：全局认证默认关闭，而局域网认证选项默认开启；首次设置管理员密码须从运行 DSH 的本机发起。 （见 lib/index.js:16-21、705-723）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-21","lib/index.js:705-723"]}
